{%- comment -%}
  MUTO — reviews in the buy box (muto-bf-review-box). A box in the dropdowns' style, between the buy box's three
  ticks and its Black Friday line: "Sound like you?" with three chips in the customers' own moments (Flat by 3pm,
  Slower to bounce back, Too many pots on the shelf; tap one to see matching reviews, tap again for all), then real
  customer reviews from REVIEWS.io rotating every 6 seconds (pauses on hover, focus or tap; arrows to step; no
  auto-rotation for people who ask for reduced motion).
  Each review: stars, the review word for word (… marks a cut), the name as REVIEWS.io shows it, the age only
  where the reviewer wrote it, a life stage only from the reviewer's own words, and "Verified buyer" only where
  REVIEWS.io marks them verified. The first three are the reviewers closest to the 35–55 buyer (46, 53, 36).
  Built 12 Nov 2026 by shopify/pdp-reviews/build_box.py, which checks every quote against REVIEWS.io; change the
  list there and rebuild. Left out: reviews IDs 51870930–51870962 (pending a check that they are genuine),
  reviews about medical conditions, and repeat postings of the same review.
  Rendered by the custom-liquid section after the buy box (ag1_plans); a script moves it into place.
{%- endcomment -%}
